  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nSee https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11560#discussion_r2631911874\n\nhttps://wpt.live/fullscreen/api/document-fullscreen-enabled-setting-allowfullscreen-timing.sub.html checks that the snapshot for `allowfullscreen` is at navigation start, I believe. That test was written as part of https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/2187 which didn't land, but https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3287 was supposed to be equivalent. Browsers fail the test, though.",
